{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master tactical spellcraft in <i><strong>Pluto</strong></i>, a roguelike where you invoke elements to cast spells. Channel elements and chain combos to conquer your foes. Will your magic be powerful enough to reach your niece\u2019s birthday?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect &amp; Cast</strong>\u00a0Acquire spells with elemental recipes and cast them through your fingertips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolving Spellbook</strong>\u00a0Discover new spells, upgrade old ones, and collect powerful artifacts that reshape your strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Distinct Playstyles\u00a0</strong>Unlock characters with unique  spells and elemental affinities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong>\u00a0Adapt to tactical enemy formations, colossal bosses, and shifting  draws. No two runs play alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Horror</strong> Experience a  dark fantasy world with art by DitchWitch</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3057670?t=1746990218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057670/753f9c3ff7b7bd7f0f3b494613fdd1a7b9012044/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746990218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057670/b71ae829518e4f17bf608eeef6670325037ffba1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746990218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057670/b71ae829518e4f17bf608eeef6670325037ffba1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746990218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class